    WebServer --> DB[(MySQL 8.0<br/>Port 3306)]
    WebServer -->|cURL HTTPS| Groq[Groq AI Cloud API<br/>llama-3.1-8b-instant]
    WebServer -->|SMTP TLS| Mail[Hostinger SMTP<br/>info@erth.dev]
    PMA[phpMyAdmin<br/>Port 8080] --> DB
```

| Layer | Technology | Details |
|---|---|---|
| **Frontend Framework** | React 19.2 + Vite 7.3 | React Router 7, Lucide Icons, Chart.js |
| **Backend API** | Native PHP 8.0+ | Micro-file endpoints, PDO Singleton, Session Auth |
| **Database** | MySQL 8.0 | InnoDB, UTF8mb4, Docker persistent volume |
| **Database Tool** | phpMyAdmin | Containerized at `http://localhost:8080` |
| **AI Integration** | Groq Cloud API | `llama-3.1-8b-instant` via PHP cURL |
| **Containerization** | Docker & Docker Compose | 3 services: `app`, `db`, `phpmyadmin` |

