## 3. Database Architecture (14 Tables)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    users ||--o{ projects : "owns"
    users ||--o{ team_members : "participates in"
    users ||--o{ user_skills : "has"
    users ||--o| user_preferences : "configures"
    projects ||--o{ project_skills : "requires"
    projects ||--o{ team_members : "contains"
    projects ||--o{ project_applications : "receives"
    projects ||--o{ project_tasks : "tracks"
    projects ||--o{ project_messages : "chats"
    users ||--o{ reviews : "gives/receives"
    users ||--o{ notifications : "receives"
```

### Table Breakdown:
1. **`users`**: User accounts (email, password_hash, full_name_en, student_id, college_key, academic_year, major, bio, avatar_url, availability [JSON], enrolled_courses [JSON], role, is_admin, email_verified, avg_rating, total_reviews).
2. **`projects`**: Project posts (owner_id, title_en, title_ar, description_en, description_ar, type, status, college_key, team_size_needed, deadline, course_name).
3. **`team_members`**: Active project members (`project_id`, `user_id`, `role`, `joined_at`).
4. **`project_applications`**: Applications to join projects (`project_id`, `applicant_id`, `message`, `status`: pending/accepted/rejected).
5. **`project_skills`**: Project skill requirements (`project_id`, `skill_id`, `importance`: required/preferred/nice_to_have).
6. **`user_skills`**: Student skills (`user_id`, `skill_id`, `proficiency`: 1 to 5).
7. **`user_preferences`**: Work style metrics (`leadership_score`, `execution_score`, `pressure_score`), weekly hours available, preferred project types [JSON].
8. **`reviews`**: Peer reviews (`project_id`, `reviewer_id`, `reviewee_id`, commitment_rating, quality_rating, collaboration_rating, comment).
9. **`notifications`**: System notifications (`user_id`, `type`, `message_en`, `message_ar`, `project_id`, `is_read`).
10. **`project_tasks`**: Kanban task cards (`project_id`, `title`, `description`, `status`: todo/in_progress/done, `assigned_to`, `position`, `deadline`).
11. **`project_messages`**: Real-time project chat messages.
12. **`activity_log`**: User & project activity audit trail.
13. **`otp_codes`**: Hashes & expiry times for email verification and password resets.
14. **`otp_rate_limits`**: Rate limiting storage for OTP requests.

