## 5. Backend API & Routing Inventory

All API endpoints are modular PHP scripts located under `/api`:

```
/api
├── config.php                  # PDO DB connection, security headers, CORS, rate limiting, auto-migrations
├── router.php                  # Dev server router for built assets
├── ai/
│   └── proxy.php               # Groq AI Cloud proxy (description writer & skill extractor)
├── admin/
│   ├── stats.php, heatmap.php, delete_user.php, delete_project.php, create_staff.php
├── auth/
│   ├── login.php, register.php, logout.php, verify.php, resend_otp.php
│   ├── reset-password.php, reset-verify.php, reset-set-password.php
│   ├── change-password.php, delete-account.php, session.php
├── projects/
│   ├── list.php, get.php, create.php, edit.php, delete.php, update-status.php
│   ├── skills.php, applications.php, apply.php, respond-invite.php, leave_project.php, remove_member.php
├── users/
│   ├── profile.php, skills.php, preferences.php, avatar.php, search.php, search-staff.php
├── matches/
│   └── eligible.php            # Multi-factor matching engine
├── tasks/                      # list.php, create.php, update.php, delete.php (Kanban)
├── chat/                       # list.php, send.php (Project chat)
├── reviews/                    # get.php, submit.php, written.php, edit.php, delete.php
├── notifications/              # list.php, read.php, clear.php, create.php
└── activity/                   # feed.php
```

