## 6. Frontend Structure & Application Flow

```
frontend/src/
├── App.jsx                     # Router config, route guards (ProtectedRoute, AdminRoute, StaffOrAdminRoute)
├── services/api.js             # Centralized API fetch client, CSRF headers, user object normalization
├── contexts/
│   ├── AuthContext.jsx         # User session, login, register, logout, profile state
│   ├── I18nContext.jsx         # Bilingual translation engine (en/ar)
│   └── ThemeContext.jsx        # Dark/light mode theme toggle
├── pages/
│   ├── Landing.jsx, Auth.jsx, Onboarding.jsx, Dashboard.jsx
│   ├── Projects.jsx, ProjectDetail.jsx, PostProject.jsx, Matches.jsx
│   ├── Profile.jsx, PublicProfile.jsx, People.jsx, Reviews.jsx
│   ├── TaskBoard.jsx, ProjectChat.jsx, Admin.jsx, Heatmap.jsx
└── components/
    ├── layout/ (AppLayout, Sidebar, Topbar)
    └── StaffRegisterModal, ConfirmModal, Toast
```

